1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:01,094
You blow out your candles

2
00:00:01,094 --> 00:00:01,702
and it's already

3
00:00:01,702 --> 00:00:02,363
your birthday

4
00:00:02,363 --> 00:00:03,480
again!

5
00:00:03,543 --> 00:00:04,667
Relax.

6
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:05,144
Your brain

7
00:00:05,144 --> 00:00:05,945
measures time

8
00:00:05,945 --> 00:00:07,367
in new memories.

9
00:00:07,402 --> 00:00:08,304
As a kid,

10
00:00:08,304 --> 00:00:10,244
everything is new...

11
00:00:10,244 --> 00:00:10,949
one summer

12
00:00:10,949 --> 00:00:12,333
lasts forever.

13
00:00:12,382 --> 00:00:13,040
Now?

14
00:00:13,040 --> 00:00:13,913
Same desk,

15
00:00:13,913 --> 00:00:14,854
same lunch...

16
00:00:14,854 --> 00:00:15,280
your brain

17
00:00:15,280 --> 00:00:16,367
doesn't bother.

18
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:17,032
Scientists think

19
00:00:17,032 --> 00:00:17,589
that's why

20
00:00:17,589 --> 00:00:19,092
a year looks...

21
00:00:19,092 --> 00:00:20,064
tiny.

22
00:00:20,064 --> 00:00:21,362
Subscribe...

23
00:00:21,362 --> 00:00:22,867
it gets weirder.

24
00:00:22,904 --> 00:00:23,527
One lab

25
00:00:23,527 --> 00:00:24,520
dropped people

26
00:00:24,520 --> 00:00:25,900
off a tower...

27
00:00:25,930 --> 00:00:26,527
they remembered

28
00:00:26,527 --> 00:00:27,055
the fall

29
00:00:27,055 --> 00:00:28,833
a third longer.

30
00:00:28,868 --> 00:00:29,293
So try

31
00:00:29,293 --> 00:00:30,633
something new.

32
00:00:30,690 --> 00:00:31,743
Or...

33
00:00:31,820 --> 00:00:33,590
happy birthday.

